// ------> Guard (to allow or not user to acces to a route).

ng g guard [guard-name]  // create a guard (it not create folder).
    choose type of guard : 
    canActivate -> for allow to acces (or not) to a route (ex: verify if user is auth/log to acces a page).
    CanActivateChild -> for allow ro acces (or not) to child routes (ex: block acces to many pages childs).
    CanDeactivate -> validate (or refuse) the exit of a route (ex: ask confirmation for exit a page form).
    CanMatch -> verify if a route can be selected when match url (ex: load a page parte only if user has a role admin). 

add code to verify stuff, and return true if it successfully pass the guard.

